# Inside the Belly (otherAreas 26) with its era module: modules/era/lua/quests/otherareas/inside_the_belly.lua, enabled by
# xi.pre(WOTG) (RESTRICT_CONTENT 1, ENABLE_WOTG 0; the other three expansions on): the 2009-2010 batch blocked, and
# Zaldon's trigger replaced by the stock hint lists in sections 2 and 3.
# FISHING_ENABLE (P6): `setting map.FISHING_ENABLE true` in the header; every section reads xi.settings.map.FISHING_ENABLE == true
# (false in settings/default/map.lua).
# Accepted (a GM), skill 40: the module's 163 (Zafmlug Bass, Giant Donko, Bhefhel Marlin, Jungle Catfish, Silver Shark;
# the quest's own has the Bladefish where this has the Jungle Catfish). An Ahtapot (in the batch) and a Mola Mola (its
# last): the wrap returns nothing: no reply (Zaldon's default is a trigger's, though the module's comment says his default
# plays), the fish kept, not completed. A Grimmonite (the 2010 Abyssea batch, on): the quest's own trade: 166 or 167;
# a GM completes the quest before the finish (the accepted section's finish is the #accepted flow's), so the
# completed section's finish plays: 350 gil. Completed: the Ahtapot again: nothing, kept; skill 75:
# the module's 165 (eight fish, Ryugu Titan, Lik and Gugrusaurus at the end); skill 39: 162 (the same list as the
# quest's); skill 50: the module's 164 (`<= 50` would play 163).
module modules/era/lua/quests/otherareas/inside_the_belly.lua
lists Selbina/Zaldon/onTrigger Selbina/Zaldon/onTrade Selbina/onEventFinish/166 Selbina/onEventFinish/167
char zone=Selbina pos=-10.3,-7.287,-6.742 job=WAR lvl=30
setting map.FISHING_ENABLE true
setting RESTRICT_CONTENT 1
setting ENABLE_WOTG 0
quest OtherAreas.InsideTheBelly accepted
skill Fishing 400
item Ahtapot
item MolaMola
item Grimmonite
login
trigger Zaldon                          # the module's 163 (the stock tier-2 list)
finish
trade Zaldon Ahtapot x1                 # blocked: nothing (no default on a trade); the fish kept
trade Zaldon MolaMola x1                # blocked: nothing; kept
trade Zaldon Grimmonite x1              # not blocked: roll <= 50 / 100 / 150: 166 (a ring), else 167
quest OtherAreas.InsideTheBelly completed # a GM (see the #accepted flow)
finish                                  # the completed section's: 350 gil (a ring on a 166)
trade Zaldon Ahtapot x1                 # completed: blocked too: nothing; kept
skill Fishing 750
trigger Zaldon                          # the module's 165
finish
skill Fishing 399
trigger Zaldon                          # 162
finish
skill Fishing 500
trigger Zaldon                          # the module's 164 (`<= 50`: 163)
finish
